"""
FULL UNIFIED SCRIPT (edited per requirements)

Binance Spot (hourly) + daily margin-universe filter + MR/TF ElasticNet regression blend
+ RuleCleaner (corr > 0.8) + Hourly Peak Exhaustion model (trained hourly)

Key requirements implemented:
(1,9) Keep trend monitoring vs mean reversion and long vs short logic (MR + TF + regime mixing).
(2) No leakage / lookahead: strict training windows and feature/label alignment.
(3) No VWAP entry: entry always next-hour open.
(4) Monitor hourly during trading: TP/SL on hourly bars (backtest sim + live loop stub).
(5) margin_spot_symbols refreshed daily (hook in main loop).
(6) RuleCleaner: drop features corr > 0.8 using ElasticNet coef magnitude priority.
(7) API limit: OHLCV fetch is forced into 7-day chunks.
(8) Peak exhaustion score model trained hourly on same feature space; used to filter/downweight trades.

Dependencies:
  pip install ccxt pandas numpy requests scikit-learn
"""

